# Environment variables consumed by web-portal-cms. Prefix every key with the module name.
# The CMS needs no settings of its own; it uses the host's shared ones (EOS_DATABASE_URL, EOS_JWT_SECRET).
# The public sign-up pages read VITE_API_URL (the API base, default /api/v1) at build time.

# Tests only: a PostgreSQL server for backend/tests/test_rls_postgres.py, as a user with CREATEDB and CREATEROLE.
# The test creates and drops its own throwaway database and role. Never point this at a real database.
# Unset, the two live row-level-security tests are skipped.
# WEB_PORTAL_CMS_TEST_POSTGRES_URL=postgresql+psycopg://user:password@localhost:5432/postgres
